Lemme take time here to say that Fire Brand is vastly underrated.
Many say it is inferior to Frost Brand.  I disagree.
They are equally effective in the main dungeon.  In Gehennom,
frost brand is better against demons, but there are plenty of other
things, such as
vampires and liches, the cold doesn't affect at all.

Also, get this:  Angels resist cold, but not fire. Archons resist both,
but the standard angel does not. Neither do priests.

So while Frost Brand is better in Gehennom, Fire Brand is better in the
endgame.  I kept it.

